                <h2>🎉 v1.5.47 Update</h2>
<ul>
    <li>✨ <b>Intel Mac Support</b><br>
        - OnText now ships as a universal app for both Apple Silicon and Intel Macs.
    </li>
    <li>🐛 <b>Hotkey Reliability Fix</b><br>
        - Improved global hotkey handling so the floating panel appears reliably across supported Macs.
    </li>
    <li>🔧 <b>AI Action Reliability</b><br>
        - Updated default ChatGPT and Gemini actions to paste selected text more reliably.
    </li>
</ul>
